#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:5
#: b2fa741ba7ae406aa8f010ae46b3f819
msgid "Setup the Build Environment on Windows"
msgstr "在 Windows 上配置构建环境"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:7
#: 21893dcf80484dfd98fe68f0c66c514b
msgid ""
"There are two options for building on Windows: Windows Subsystem for Linux "
"(WSL) or Cygwin. New developers should use WSL as it offers faster "
"compilation times, greater compatibility, and a larger support base from "
"other developers."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上构建有两种方式：适用于 Linux 的 Windows 子系统（WSL）或 Cygwin。新开发者应使用 "
"WSL，因为它编译速度更快、兼容性更好，并且拥有更多其他开发者的支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:11
#: 839da55ee6fd426cb2944feb934004a2
msgid "Setup for building with waf using WSL (Windows 10 and 11 only)"
msgstr "使用 WSL 配合 waf 进行构建的配置方法（仅限 Windows 10 和 11）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:13
#: aaf93012cf914ea39b417154f0c45fa7
msgid ""
"Install WSL as described `here <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/windows/wsl/install>`__"
msgstr ""
"按照 `此处 <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/install>`__ 的说明安装 WSL"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:14
#: b1192fedda174e5299bc0967e0999e1d
msgid ""
"If Windows 10 :ref:`follow these instructions <building-setup-"
"windows10_new>`, if Windows 11 :ref:`follow these instructions <building-"
"setup-windows11>`."
msgstr ""
"如果是 Windows 10，请 :ref:`按照这些说明操作 <building-setup-windows10_new>`；如果是 Windows "
"11，请 :ref:`按照这些说明操作 <building-setup-windows11>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:15
#: da61b40c73124879895b1d328d9eb9bb
msgid ""
"(optional, if you wish to use VSCode editor) :ref:`Setup VSCode as described"
" here <editing-the-code-with-vscode>`"
msgstr ""
"（可选，如需使用 VSCode 编辑器）:ref:`按照此处说明配置 VSCode <editing-the-code-with-vscode>`"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:19
#: a9fe0a1ef61840fbaf1c2577943b93bd
msgid "Setup for building with waf using Cygwin"
msgstr "使用 Cygwin 配合 waf 进行构建的配置方法"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:23
#: 601ecac6c87d4fb0b3fdbdd30d8dd9f7
msgid ""
"Cygwin is not recommended for new developers. However, building using Cygwin"
" is sometimes usefull if you need to compile SITL binaries for Windows. "
"However, you can create Windows SITL executables without using Cygwin, "
"following the instructions given :ref:`here <mp-sitl-custom-code>`."
msgstr ""
"不建议新开发者使用 Cygwin。但是，如果需要为 Windows 编译 SITL 二进制文件，有时使用 Cygwin 构建会很有用。不过，您也可以按照"
" :ref:`此处 <mp-sitl-custom-code>` 的说明，在不使用 Cygwin 的情况下创建 Windows SITL 可执行文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:25
#: 338b9f53b53b4694bfd21c5f90877019
msgid ""
":ref:`Install Cygwin as described here <building-setup-windows-cygwin>`"
msgstr ":ref:`按照此处说明安装 Cygwin <building-setup-windows-cygwin>`"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:26
#: 25a2a748debc4c9ba83e81349d1dd830
msgid ""
":ref:`Setup Eclipse as described here <building-setup-windows-eclipse>` "
"(optional)"
msgstr ":ref:`按照此处说明配置 Eclipse <building-setup-windows-eclipse>`（可选）"
